Font metrics: src/text/metrics.generated.js holds character advance widths
measured from Liberation Sans Bold and Liberation Serif Bold. No font data or
glyph outlines are included; only the measured widths are stored, so that
letters can be placed one by one. The fonts themselves are drawn by each
viewer's system (Arial, Times New Roman, Courier New or their equivalents).

Demo statuses and quotes in src/text/content.js are written for this project.
Owners replace them with their own text through environment variables, which
never become part of this repository.

Third-party code: none is bundled. The project has no runtime or build
dependencies. Wrangler (Cloudflare) and ImageMagick are optional external tools
used during development and are not distributed with this repository.

